<!--
    Kill-Switch sinkhole icon (GppBad-style shield with X).
    Displayed in the big circle when KillSwitchManager is in
    SINKHOLE state - the tunnel is down but the block-all tun
    fd is suppressing traffic to prevent leaks.

    Rendered white so the red-tinted circle (widget_kill_switch
    color filter) reads it clearly. 24x24 viewport matches the
    Material Icons Filled.GppBad glyph this mirrors from the
    in-app ConnectScreen sinkhole button.
-->
